[
  {"type":"fill","q":"用辗转相除法求 \\(\\gcd(252,198)=\\) ____","answer":["18"],"why":"\\(252=1\\times198+54\\)，\\(198=3\\times54+36\\)，\\(54=1\\times36+18\\)，\\(36=2\\times18+0\\)。"},
  {"type":"fill","q":"\\(\\operatorname{lcm}(252,198)=\\) ____","answer":["2772"],"why":"\\(252\\times198\\div\\gcd=49896\\div18=2772\\)；或 \\(2^2\\times3^2\\times7\\times11=2772\\)。"},
  {"type":"fill","q":"已知 \\(\\gcd(30,21)=3\\)，且 \\(3=30x+21\\cdot3\\)，则整数 \\(x=\\) ____","answer":["-2"],"why":"\\(30=1\\times21+9\\)，\\(21=2\\times9+3\\)，回代 \\(3=21-2\\times9=21-2(30-21)=3\\times21-2\\times30\\)。"},
  {"type":"fill","q":"\\(168=2^3\\times3\\times7\\)，\\(300=2^2\\times3\\times5^2\\)，则 \\(\\operatorname{lcm}(168,300)=\\) ____","answer":["4200"],"why":"取各素因子较大幂：\\(2^3\\times3\\times5^2\\times7=4200\\)。"},
  {"type":"choice","q":"设 \\(a\\in\\mathbb{N}^+\\)，下列等式错误的是","options":["\\(\\gcd(0,a)=a\\)","\\(\\gcd(1,a)=1\\)","\\(\\operatorname{lcm}(1,a)=a\\)","\\(\\gcd(0,a)=0\\)"],"answer":3,"why":"\\(0\\) 被任何整数整除，\\(0\\) 与 \\(a\\) 的公因子即 \\(a\\) 的因子，最大为 \\(a\\)。"},
  {"type":"choice","q":"关于 \\(6, 10, 15\\)，正确的是","options":["两两互素","三者的最大公约数为 1，但不两两互素","三者的最大公约数为 2","任意两个的最大公约数都大于 5"],"answer":1,"why":"\\(\\gcd(6,10)=2\\)，\\(\\gcd(6,15)=3\\)，\\(\\gcd(10,15)=5\\)，但三者没有公共素因子。"},
  {"type":"choice","q":"辗转相除法依据的等式是（\\(a=qb+r\\)）","options":["\\(\\gcd(a,b)=\\gcd(b,r)\\)","\\(\\gcd(a,b)=\\gcd(q,r)\\)","\\(\\gcd(a,b)=r\\)","\\(\\gcd(a,b)=\\gcd(a,q)\\)"],"answer":0,"why":"\\(a\\) 与 \\(b\\) 的公因子恰是 \\(b\\) 与 \\(r=a-qb\\) 的公因子。"},
  {"type":"choice","q":"存在整数 \\(x,y\\) 使 \\(xa+yb=1\\)，这等价于","options":["\\(a,b\\) 都是素数","\\(a\\mid b\\)","\\(a,b\\) 互素","\\(\\operatorname{lcm}(a,b)=1\\)"],"answer":2,"why":"互素 \\(\\iff\\) 存在 \\(x,y\\) 使 \\(xa+yb=1\\)；例如 \\(4\\) 与 \\(9\\) 互素但都不是素数。"}
]
